<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Feb 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Feb 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Dresdner Bank, NordLB and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT AG</p>
<p> AMT ** 1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    06.FEB.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.025    PAY DATE    23.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN DEM ON 31.JAN.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  22.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	PFANDBRIEF SERIES 1071</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
